Z||000016||Fformula88||12-10-2001||10:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Pyric:<BR><B> <BR>The new Sentra SE-R boasts almost the same HP as the V6 Fiero out of only 4 cylinders.  Probably at a higher RPM,  but that is also non-Turbo.  A lot of power for a car that size.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, all those cars boast more HP than a V6 Fiero out of four bangers.  Their problem is they do not boast more torque.<P>They are cars that are best served on the track where you can get the RPM's up and keep them there.  For around-town driving, I am sure a V6 is more satisfying.  Its still a lot of power out of a four banger!||||reg||1
